.TH geectl-remote-link-target 1  "geectl-remote-link-target 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-link\-target \- Show the link target of a package, when it is a link
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote link\-target\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the link target of a package, when it is a link
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to show the link target of
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
